# Read by `vite build` (production mode).
#
# You do not normally write this file. `just web-deploy-dev` / `just
# web-deploy-prod` generate `.env.production` from the deployed stack's own
# `ApiUrl` and then build, so the two halves cannot drift apart. Copy this
# only to build a bundle by hand against something else.
#
# The deployed frontend's origin is already allowed by the API: the SAM
# template hands its own CloudFront domain to `API_CORS_ORIGINS`. Serving the
# bundle from anywhere else means adding that origin to `CorsOrigins` in
# infra/samconfig.toml and redeploying the backend.
#
# Everything here ships inside the bundle. Never put a secret in this file.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://example.lambda-url.us-east-1.on.aws
